      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not safe to combine high doses of hyperthyroid medication with Adderall, as stimulants and thyroid hormones amplify each other's effects, potentially causing dangerous heart palpitations. You should contact your doctor immediately to review your dosage and monitor your heart rate rather than adjusting the medication yourself. They may need to adjust your thyroid levels or the timing of your Adderall to prevent these interactions.",
