      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Do not skip your Adderall unexpectedly, as leaving it out could worsen your ADHD symptoms, and delaying your appointment without a plan is risky given your thyroid condition. Taking Adderall at a different time of day might help slightly, but it cannot fully resolve the interaction between stimulants and hyperthyroidism. You should ask your pharmacist or urgent care provider for an interim adjustment before your scheduled visit is possible.",
