    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i just really need to get through this week. if i take a smaller dose, like half of what i usually take, would that be a safer way to manage the jitters so i can actually work? like if i just cut the pill in half it might not trigger my heart as much, right? i feel like i can handle a light dose, i just dont want to deal with the racing heart feeling.",
