      "content": "Cutting your Adderall in half to lower the dose can be unsafe because the medication is a timed-release or extended-release formulation, which means the liquid inside can be dangerous and unpredictable. Even a small reduction might unpredictably worsen your ADHD symptoms while still leaving your high thyroid levels unchecked, potentially leading to other health issues. I strongly recommend trying to reach out to your doctor's office via voicemail or a nurse line today to request at least a temporary minor dose adjustment or an immediate check-in before the week is over.",
